WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:07.250
So now let me explain why Donald Trump is
panicking, why he has replaced his campaign

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.799
manager with only three and a half months
to go before the.

00:00:11.799 --> 00:00:18.099
Five new election polls were released yesterday,
and Joe Biden is ahead by as little as three

00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:21.690
points in the right leaning Rasmussen poll.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:28.249
And by as much as 15 points nationally in
the latest Quinnipiac University poll.

00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:34.910
In that same Quinnipiac poll, Donald Trump's
approval has collapsed to 36 percent.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:42.270
No president has had a 36 percent approval
this close to their reelection Election Day

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.449
potential reelection.

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:45.980
Election Day for a very, very long time.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.239
I think this is actually worse than George
H.W. Bush in 92.

00:00:49.239 --> 00:00:50.630
But I'd have to go back and look.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:53.120
So let's look at the new polling we got yesterday.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.480
Just a ton of new polls, five general election
polls.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:00.420
NBC News Wall Street Journal says Biden is
up by 11.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.010
CNBC says Biden is up 10.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:06.250
Rasmussen, as I mentioned, that's the right
wing pollster.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.730
The best one for Trump has Biden up only three.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:14.210
Quinnipiac is the most insane one, which says
Biden is winning by 15.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:18.920
And then The Economist's YouGov poll released
yesterday says Biden is up by nine.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.840
You also have some interesting state polls.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:25.240
One from this morning in Arizona says Biden
is up five in Arizona.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.250
A North Carolina poll from yesterday says
Biden is up.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:33.270
One Florida poll says Biden up seven, which
if Biden wins Florida by seven, you're looking

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.360
at a historic defeat for Donald Trump.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.540
Big if, big, big, big if.

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.470
In Pennsylvania, Biden is up eight.

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:43.240
And in Michigan, Wisconsin and a different
Arizona poll.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.180
Joe Biden is up by six.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:49.090
And then if you look at Texas, we saw one
poll earlier this week that had Biden up five

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.200
in Texas.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.770
The latest poll out of Texas has Trump up
two.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:57.370
But understand that I don't really think Texas
is a place Biden is going to win.

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:01.540
But Trump won Texas by nine in 2016.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:07.071
If Trump only wins Texas by two, that is a
major signal about trouble for Donald Trump

00:02:07.071 --> 00:02:08.220
nationally.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.709
So let's pick one of these and look a little
more closely at the Quinnipiac poll.

00:02:11.709 --> 00:02:17.090
Not only does it have Joe Biden up fifteen,
it has Trump approval at 36 percent, with

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.129
60 percent disapproving.

00:02:19.129 --> 00:02:22.709
And the internals on specific issues are important
to look at.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:26.670
So let's put up on the screen and I'll tell
you what we're looking at here.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.909
This is the Quinnipiac poll.

00:02:28.909 --> 00:02:33.459
Key issues, Trump versus Biden on handling
a crisis.

00:02:33.459 --> 00:02:39.739
Biden leads 57 38 by 19 points on handling
health care.

00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:42.319
Biden leads 58 to 35.

00:02:42.319 --> 00:02:46.280
That's 23 points on Corona virus response.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:51.209
Biden leads 59 to 35 on addressing racial
inequality.

00:02:51.209 --> 00:02:52.209
Just brutal.

00:02:52.209 --> 00:02:54.549
Biden ahead by 32 points.

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:58.970
And this is maybe the most interesting one
to me on handling the economy.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:02.209
Biden is now ahead of Trump 50 to 45.

00:03:02.209 --> 00:03:08.840
That's the most important factor to me, because
we often have this situation where Republicans

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.650
are just more trusted on the economy.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:14.819
I discussed with you last week how it's not
really borne out by the facts.

00:03:14.819 --> 00:03:17.830
Stock market does better under Democratic
presidents.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.269
Unemployment is lower under Democratic presidents
on average.

00:03:21.269 --> 00:03:25.290
Recessions are more likely under Republican
presidents.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:29.510
Inflation is lower under Democratic presidents,
et cetera, et cetera.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:33.499
But the stereotype is that Republicans are
good for the economy and for business, even

00:03:33.499 --> 00:03:35.239
though it's actually not true.

00:03:35.239 --> 00:03:41.489
The fact that Joe Biden now leads Trump by
five on the economy is massive because that

00:03:41.489 --> 00:03:44.290
was essentially Trump's last stand.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.290
So now what?

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.290
We've got it right.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.450
We can all just kind of hang for the next
four months.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.400
No, no, no, no.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.769
Everyone must vote.

00:03:51.769 --> 00:03:55.929
Do not become complacent even for a second.

00:03:55.929 --> 00:03:57.510
We don't have it.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.849
Trump knows he's up against the wall.

00:03:59.849 --> 00:04:03.739
Trump knows that it takes eight to 10 weeks
to flatten the curve and that that's getting

00:04:03.739 --> 00:04:08.500
us dangerously close to Election Day and that
the cases are still going up, not down.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.310
So he knows he needs dirty tricks, okay.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:17.480
He knows he needs deceptive online campaigns,
voter suppression, trying to hide corona virus

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.350
data or data or both, really.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.300
So do not become complacent even for a moment.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:27.730
And we'll have more coverage of this and this
latest polling on The David Pakman Show Instagram

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:28.730
page.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.920
That's David Pakman show on Instagram.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.600
Follow us there.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:05:01.160
We'll have much more

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:53.330
for

00:05:53.330 --> 00:06:00.380
you 
right after this short break.

